    "chunk_text": "& his sunu Arnulf feng to rice. & Willelm eorl sceolde ben his geheald.& Franca cyng eac.& com \u00fea Rodbriht eorl & ofsloh his Her \u00c6dwine eorl & Morkere eorl uthlupon & mislice ferdon on wudu & on felda. \u00d0a gewende Morkere eorl to Elig on scipe.And Eadwine eorl wear\u00f0 ofslagen arhlice fram his & com se biscop Egelwine.& Siward Bearn.& fela hund manna mid heom into Elig. & \u00fea \u00fee se cyng Willelm \u00fe\u00e6t geaxode.\u00fea bead he ut scipfyrde & landfyrde.& \u00feet land abutan s\u00e6t. & \u00fea utlagan \u00fea ealle on hand eodan.\u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Egelwine biscop.& Morkere eorl.& ealle \u00fea \u00fee mid & ealle \u00fea \u00fee mid him woldon.& he hi ahtlice utl\u00e6dde. & se cyng genam scipa & w\u00e6pna & sceattas manega.& \u00fea men he ateah swa swa he wolde.& Her Willelm cyng l\u00e6dde scipfyrde & landfyrde to Scotlande.& \u00fe\u00e6t land on \u00fea s\u00e6healfe mid & se cyng Melcolm com & gri\u00f0ede wi\u00f0 \u00feone cyng Willelm & gislas sealde.& his man w\u00e6s. & se cyng ham gewende mid ealre his fyrde. & se biscop Egelric for\u00f0ferde.he w\u00e6s to biscop hadod to Eoferwic.ac hit w\u00e6s mid unrihte him & man geaf him \u00fe\u00e6t biscoprice on Dunholme.& he heafde hit \u00fea hwile \u00fee he wolde.& forlet hit \u00d0a \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00fee Willelm cyng gewan Englalande.",
